WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.801 --> 00:00:05.872
Open the page type to create a reusable block.

2
00:00:05.872 --> 00:00:08.000
Switch to content and create a Text field.

3
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:11.022
Label the field Headline. Its key is headline.

4
00:00:11.022 --> 00:00:16.019
Set the default content for the field.

5
00:00:16.019 --> 00:00:19.388
Reference the field in your component markup.

6
00:00:19.388 --> 00:00:24.689
Preview the result, then create the block.
